ent-XenoborgModuleChameleonProjector = 變色龍投影機 異種機器人模組 | chameleon projector xenoborg module
    .desc = 配備變色龍投影機的模組。 | Module with a chameleon projector.
ent-XenoborgModuleCloakDevice = 隱形裝置 異種博格模組 | cloaking device xenoborg module
    .desc = 一個內建裝置的模組，可讓異種生化人短暫地處於半隱形狀態。 | Module with a device that allows xenoborgs to become semi-invisible for some time.
ent-XenoborgModuleSuperCloakDevice = 隱形裝置 異種博格模組 | invisibility device xenoborg module
    .desc = 一個內建裝置的模組，能讓異種生化人短暫地徹底隱形。 | Module with a device that allows xenoborgs to become truly invisible for a short amount of time.
